Keep a shared candidate as 0.
Keep a shared prime as 0.
Set prime to 1.
Keep a shared flipped as 0.
Keep a shared arrived as 0.
To probe from divisor (a whole number).
If divisor times divisor is more than candidate, return.
If candidate modulo divisor is 0, set prime to 0, return.
Probe from divisor plus 1.

To flip from value (a whole number).
If value is 0, return.
Set flipped to flipped times 10 plus value modulo 10.
Flip from value divided by 10.

Set candidate to 13.
Repeat while arrived is 0.
Set prime to 1.
Probe from 2.
Set flipped to 0.
Flip from candidate.
If prime is 1 and flipped is candidate, set arrived to 1.
If arrived is 0, add 1 to candidate.

Show candidate.
